{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a103058b23cf67d68e5f6ac447fa599d34aef378afab87d899b7a8540c800c7b","ja":"今日のお仕事はネットの生配信。\n『STARDOM ROAD』完結記念の番組で……","zh":"今天的工作是网络直播。\n是《STARDOM ROAD》完结纪念节目……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5e17c4213d310e088d34b345c605142f7c04377b6136cb914b80baddf39fd428","ja":"はーい、それじゃあ次は……\n『今、私達これがしたい！』のコーナーよ♪","zh":"好——那么接下来是……\n“现在，我们想做这个！”环节哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b1e54f76ed8f46d6f03804ee6dfd68566bd4f62f8c72428b52369b9e973e8e81","ja":"自分がしたいことを、順番に発表するコーナーです。","zh":"这是一个按顺序宣布自己想做的事情的环节。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"e3eafb157e402620fdbabbf4642442c7c0dde3387d95f66be8330fca8cc4b418","ja":"事前にアンケートをとったのですが、\nお互いの内容は知らないので、楽しみです♪","zh":"事前做过了问卷调查，\n不过彼此都不知道对方写了什么，好期待呀♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"338688dfda9028e64a585f501cb2e8571e480608f9bba68d4aff65686b100e43","ja":"それじゃあ、アナウンスしていきましょう！\nトップバッターは……ミズキ、プリーズです！","zh":"那么，我们这就开始播报吧！\n打头阵的是……瑞希，拜托你啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"e5d28b262a86942399a8e8d7e545dc661ba08e3e4880a057369f75bf9ec8c863","ja":"一番手ですね……責任重大だぞ。","zh":"打头阵啊……责任重大哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f411dad96957c828f641dda8f793f89cad28f4d268227676c5456e060b36c926","ja":"私のやりたいことは……、\n「みんなでマジックショーを観に行きたい」です。","zh":"我想做的事情是……\n“想大家一起去看魔术秀”。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"114a88108e0733ae397cb83ae909d221357e42882ac7c6f8e40cd9a8c69bc69e","ja":"わぁ、素敵ですね！\n本物のマジックショー、私も観てみたいです♪","zh":"哇，太棒了！\n真正的魔术秀，我也很想看一看呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e4c585127d9926b65a35df12b5f2137a47d9809241a1cf4d7d922bf4fa2b5f42","ja":"はい。プロのマジックショー……\nみなさんと行けたら嬉しいです。","zh":"好的。专业的魔术秀……\n如果能和大家一起去就太好了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c5ccfec7217345be87843f3ce13496a427a6e7b0a4c184db2215e3377bab878d","ja":"さて、他の人のしたいことも聞いていきましょう。\n次は……最上さん、お願いします。","zh":"好了，也来听听其他人的想法吧。\n接下来是……最上，拜托你了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"a34ecf2d683143255b73da93a328fa7bfb7dd7c8ce6ff4647286ff878b713d3a","ja":"はい。私は……「先週オープンした大行列の\nうどん屋さんに、みなさんと行きたい」です！","zh":"是的。我……“想和大家一起去上周\n新开业的那家大排长龙的乌冬面店”！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"60e7ab46d996d7cb0bb71b8bbb304ab2a105ee2570567fee754a5d05a80f5c6d","ja":"シズカが気にしていた、あのショップですね！\nロコも味わってみたいです～♪","zh":"就是静香很在意的，那家店对吧！\nROCO也想去尝尝呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"8ef2694b2e5233c7e4592a8f4dacee756689d80e4fb6f3177f6c53833bc7b62d","ja":"私も……あら？　今、カンペ……じゃなかった。\n天の声さんからの連絡が出たわ……ええっ！？","zh":"我也……哎呀？刚才提词板……不对。\n天之声发来联络了……诶诶！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"d3f1787248d591bc5208feb55a0584a83b4153b63a2732cde3f630388bd4fdce","ja":"「皆さんのやりたいこと、完結記念のご褒美に\nできる範囲で実現させちゃいます」！？","zh":"“大家的愿望，就当作完结纪念的奖励，\n在力所能及的范围内帮大家实现吧”！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1532.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"749d5167704f430b90d3e4ec740be6db35ac4424f6f9cd1e0ec5f3138684f27d","ja":"えっ……ほ、ほんとですかっ！？","zh":"诶……真、真的吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
